      "content": "what does that even mean? \"change the variables\"? i dont have any variables left to change. i've cut everything out, i work every hour i can, and i'm still sinking. it feels like the only way to actually stop the math from hurting is to just... stop being part of the equation altogether. like, the only way to win a game that's rigged is to just not play.",
